 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Once upon time, deep in the woods, there stood an old cabin, tucked away from prying eyes. It was the hideaway of a brave adventurer who had found treasure maps hidden in old books. No, just a friendly spirit who loved the adventurer. It was this spirit that taught the brave one to read the ancient symbols on the maps. Maybe switch to a cozy firelight story about a brave pet dog who found lost hikers in the snow. Sure, why don' we tell it together? Okay, you start with the cabin, and I' finish with the dog.",
